  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Brazil 2023 &#x2013; Hackaton Recife</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed DRRS team will be part of the Hackaton in Recife.With the Hackaton, together with a team from Recife, the DRRS team will try to achieve a reasonably justified assessment of the climate change impacts of rainfall intensification and sea level rise on different stakeholders in the city of Recife, and to develop adaptation strategies for the short, medium and longer term in the water management infrastructure and urban spatial development domains.DRRS encourages inclusiveness of all stakeholders in the process, integrated holistic approaches on the problem analyses and solutions, including taking into account Nature-based Solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
